{"findings":[{"rule_id":"NM-002","evidence":[{"kind":"note","ref":"N3","page":1,"quote":"3) GRINDING TO BE DONE BEFORE AND AFTER PLATING."},{"kind":"note","ref":"N4","page":1,"quote":"4) MAINTAIN ALLTHE DIMENSIONS AFTER PLATING"}],"comment":"Note N4 requires all dimensions to be maintained after plating, but note N3 mandates grinding after plating, which removes material and changes the plated dimensions. This contradiction leaves manufacturing unable to determine whether final sizes apply before or after the post-plating grind. The designer should clarify which dimensions are pre-grind and which are final post-plating/post-grind."
  ,
  "recommended_correction":"Revise N4 to specify that only designated dimensions are to be held after plating, or state explicitly that final dimensions apply after the post-plating grinding operation called out in N3."}]}
